#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid ""
"This page is a quick reference for the commands. It complements the "
"xref:development/overview.adoc[Developer Guide overview], xref:edge/"
"build.adoc[Build OpenEMS Edge] and xref:ui/build.adoc[Build OpenEMS UI]. If "
"you do not yet know OSGi, bnd and Gradle, start with xref:development/"
"fundamentals/osgi-and-tools.adoc[OSGi and tools]."
msgstr ""
"Diese Seite ist die Kurzreferenz der Befehle. Sie ergänzt "
"xref:latest@development/overview.adoc[Overview], xref:latest@edge/"
"build.adoc[Build OpenEMS Edge] und xref:latest@ui/build.adoc[Build OpenEMS "
"UI]. Wer OSGi, bnd und Gradle noch nicht kennt, beginnt mit xref:development/"
"fundamentals/osgi-and-tools.adoc[OSGi und Werkzeuge]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repository structure"
msgstr "Aufbau des Repositorys"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Path\n"
"| Content\n"
"\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.*+`\n"
"| bundles of the Edge (devices, Controllers, core)\n"
"| `+io.openems.backend.*+`\n"
"| bundles of the Backend\n"
"| `+io.openems.common*+`, `+io.openems.core.*+`, `+io.openems.shared.*+`\n"
"| shared code\n"
"| `+cnf/+`\n"
"| bnd workspace configuration: dependencies (`+build.bnd+`), Checkstyle (`+checkstyle.xml+`)\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.application/EdgeApp.bndrun+`\n"
"| start description of the Edge: framework, bundles, runtime parameters\n"
"| `+ui/+`\n"
"| Angular/Ionic UI\n"
"| `+doc/+`\n"
"| this documentation (Antora/AsciiDoc)\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pfad\n"
"| Inhalt\n"
"\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.*+`\n"
"| Bundles der Edge (Geräte, Controller, Kern)\n"
"| `+io.openems.backend.*+`\n"
"| Bundles des Backends\n"
"| `+io.openems.common*+`, `+io.openems.core.*+`, `+io.openems.shared.*+`\n"
"| gemeinsamer Code\n"
"| `+cnf/+`\n"
"| bnd-Workspace-Konfiguration: Abhängigkeiten (`+build.bnd+`), Checkstyle (`+checkstyle.xml+`)\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.application/EdgeApp.bndrun+`\n"
"| Startbeschreibung der Edge: Framework, Bundles, Laufzeit-Parameter\n"
"| `+ui/+`\n"
"| Angular/Ionic-Oberfläche\n"
"| `+doc/+`\n"
"| diese Dokumentation (Antora/AsciiDoc)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid ""
"Each bundle has the same structure: `+bnd.bnd+` (name, `+-buildpath+`, `+-"
"testpath+`), `+src/+`, `+test/+` and `+readme.adoc+`."
msgstr ""
"Jedes Bundle hat dieselbe Struktur: `+bnd.bnd+` (Name, `+-buildpath+`, `+-"
"testpath+`), `+src/+`, `+test/+` und `+readme.adoc+`."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Building Edge and Backend"
msgstr "Edge und Backend bauen"

#. type: #sec-building-edge-and-backend
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid "All commands in the root directory of the repository:"
msgstr "Alle Befehle im Wurzelverzeichnis des Repositorys:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"./gradlew buildEdge          # Fat-JAR of the Edge to build/openems-edge.jar\n"
"./gradlew buildBackend       # Fat-JAR of the Backend to build/openems-backend.jar\n"
"./gradlew buildBackendEdge   # Fat-JAR of the Backend-Edge to build/openems-backend-edge.jar\n"
"./gradlew buildComponents    # compile all bundles without packing a JAR\n"
"./gradlew :io.openems.edge.meter.janitza:jar             # JAR of a single bundle to <bundle>/generated/\n"
"./gradlew :io.openems.edge.meter.janitza:test            # tests of a bundle\n"
"./gradlew :io.openems.edge.meter.janitza:checkstyleMain  # Checkstyle of a bundle\n"
"./gradlew checkstyleAll      # Checkstyle across all bundles\n"
msgstr ""
"./gradlew buildEdge          # Fat-JAR der Edge nach build/openems-edge.jar\n"
"./gradlew buildBackend       # Fat-JAR des Backends nach build/openems-backend.jar\n"
"./gradlew buildBackendEdge   # Fat-JAR der Backend-Edge nach build/openems-backend-edge.jar\n"
"./gradlew buildComponents    # alle Bundles übersetzen, ohne JAR zu packen\n"
"./gradlew :io.openems.edge.meter.janitza:jar             # JAR eines einzelnen Bundles nach <Bundle>/generated/\n"
"./gradlew :io.openems.edge.meter.janitza:test            # Tests eines Bundles\n"
"./gradlew :io.openems.edge.meter.janitza:checkstyleMain  # Checkstyle eines Bundles\n"
"./gradlew checkstyleAll      # Checkstyle über alle Bundles\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid ""
"The target path of the JARs can be changed via the Gradle property "
"`+oems.edge.output+` or the environment variable `+OEMS_EDGE_OUTPUT+` (`+…"
"backend…+` accordingly)."
msgstr ""
"Der Zielpfad der JARs lässt sich über die Gradle-Property "
"`+oems.edge.output+` bzw. die Umgebungsvariable `+OEMS_EDGE_OUTPUT+` ändern "
"(entsprechend `+…backend…+`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid ""
"Checkstyle runs with zero warnings allowed. Before a pull request, "
"`+checkstyleMain+` should be free of errors for every changed bundle; see "
"also the xref:development/coding-guidelines.adoc[Coding Guidelines]."
msgstr ""
"Checkstyle läuft mit null erlaubten Warnungen. Vor einem Pull Request sollte "
"`+checkstyleMain+` für jedes geänderte Bundle fehlerfrei sein; siehe auch "
"die xref:latest@development/coding-guidelines.adoc[Coding Guidelines]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid ""
"A new bundle does not need to be entered in a list; Gradle finds all "
"directories with `+bnd.bnd+`. To be part of the Edge JAR, however, it must "
"be listed in `+EdgeApp.bndrun+` under `+-runrequires+`."
msgstr ""
"Ein neues Bundle muss nicht in eine Liste eingetragen werden; Gradle findet "
"alle Verzeichnisse mit `+bnd.bnd+`. Damit es in der Edge-JAR landet, muss es "
"aber in `+EdgeApp.bndrun+` unter `+-runrequires+` stehen."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Starting the Edge locally"
msgstr "Edge lokal starten"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "java -jar build/openems-edge.jar\n"
msgstr "java -jar build/openems-edge.jar\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid ""
"Without configuration, the Edge reports “There are no Schedulers "
"configured!” every second. This is normal."
msgstr ""
"Ohne Konfiguration meldet die Edge jede Sekunde „There are no Schedulers "
"configured!“. Das ist normal."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid ""
"**Where the configuration is located:** `+EdgeApp.bndrun+` sets `+c:/openems/"
"config+` for the directory `+felix.cm.dir+` and `+openems.data.dir=c:/"
"openems/data+` for data (e.g. rrd4j history). On macOS or Linux these are "
"relative paths; a folder named `+c:+` is then created in the working "
"directory. You can set your own paths at startup:"
msgstr ""
"**Wo die Konfiguration liegt:** Die Komponenten-Konfiguration speichert der "
"OSGi Configuration Admin als Textdateien im Verzeichnis `+felix.cm.dir+`. In "
"`+EdgeApp.bndrun+` ist dafür `+c:/openems/config+` eingetragen, für Daten "
"(z. B. rrd4j-Historie) `+openems.data.dir=c:/openems/data+`. Unter macOS "
"oder Linux sind das relative Pfade; es entsteht dann ein Ordner mit dem "
"Namen `+c:+` im Arbeitsverzeichnis. Eigene Pfade setzt man beim Start:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java -Dfelix.cm.dir=$HOME/openems/config \\\n"
"     -Dopenems.data.dir=$HOME/openems/data \\\n"
"     -jar build/openems-edge.jar\n"
msgstr ""
"java -Dfelix.cm.dir=$HOME/openems/config \\\n"
"     -Dopenems.data.dir=$HOME/openems/data \\\n"
"     -jar build/openems-edge.jar\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid ""
"**First configuration:** see xref:gettingstarted.adoc[Getting Started]. The "
"Apache Felix Web Console runs at `+http://localhost:8080/system/console/"
"configMgr+` (port from `+org.osgi.service.http.port+`). For experiments "
"without hardware, there are simulator bundles "
"(`+io.openems.edge.simulator+`)."
msgstr ""
"**Erste Konfiguration:** siehe xref:latest@gettingstarted.adoc[Getting "
"Started]. Die Apache Felix Web Console läuft unter `+http://localhost:8080/"
"system/console/configMgr+` (Port aus `+org.osgi.service.http.port+`). Für "
"Versuche ohne Hardware gibt es Simulator-Bundles "
"(`+io.openems.edge.simulator+`)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "UI in development mode"
msgstr "Oberfläche im Entwicklungsmodus"

#. type: #sec-building-the-ui
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid "In the directory `+ui/+`:"
msgstr "Im Verzeichnis `+ui/+`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"npm ci\n"
"npx ng serve -c openems-edge-dev       # connects to ws://<host>:8085 (Edge directly)\n"
"npx ng serve -c openems-backend-dev    # connects to the local Backend\n"
msgstr ""
"npm ci\n"
"npx ng serve -c openems-edge-dev       # verbindet mit ws://<host>:8085 (Edge direkt)\n"
"npx ng serve -c openems-backend-dev    # verbindet mit dem lokalen Backend\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid ""
"The target URLs are in `+ui/src/themes/openems/environments/edge-dev.ts+` "
"and `+backend-dev.ts+`. Tests and lint:"
msgstr ""
"Die Ziel-URLs stehen in `+ui/src/themes/openems/environments/edge-dev.ts+` "
"bzw. `+backend-dev.ts+`. Tests und Lint:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"npm test -- --watch=false --browsers=ChromeHeadlessCI\n"
"npm run lint\n"
msgstr ""
"npm test -- --watch=false --browsers=ChromeHeadlessCI\n"
"npm run lint\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid ""
"Changed texts in the UI must be added in `+ui/src/app/shared/i18n/+`; `+npm "
"run lint+` checks the translation keys."
msgstr ""
"Geänderte Texte in der Oberfläche müssen in `+ui/src/app/shared/i18n/+` "
"nachgetragen werden; `+npm run lint+` prüft die Übersetzungsschlüssel."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Building the UI"
msgstr "Oberfläche bauen"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"npm ci\n"
"npx ng build -c \"openems,openems-edge-prod,prod\"\n"
msgstr ""
"npm ci\n"
"npx ng build -c \"openems,openems-edge-prod,prod\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid ""
"The result is in `+ui/target/+`: static files for a web server. The "
"configurations in `+ui/angular.json+` are combined:"
msgstr ""
"Das Ergebnis liegt in `+ui/target/+`: statische Dateien für einen Webserver. "
"Die Konfigurationen in `+ui/angular.json+` werden kombiniert:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Configuration\n"
"| Effect\n"
"\n"
"| `+openems+`\n"
"| theme from `+src/themes/openems/+`\n"
"| `+prod+`\n"
"| production build: AOT, minified, file names with hash, without source maps, with license file\n"
"| `+openems-edge-prod+`\n"
"| Edge directly via `+ws(s)://<host>:8075+`. The default port of `+Controller.Api.Websocket+` is 8085, so change it there.\n"
"| `+openems-edge-docker+`\n"
"| Edge via `+ws(s)://<host>/openems-edge+`; needs the nginx proxy of the UI image\n"
"| `+openems-backend-prod+`\n"
"| Backend via `+ws(s)://<host>:8082+`\n"
"| `+openems-backend-docker+`\n"
"| Backend via `+ws(s)://<host>/openems-backend+`\n"
msgstr ""
"| Konfiguration\n"
"| Wirkung\n"
"\n"
"| `+openems+`\n"
"| Theme aus `+src/themes/openems/+`\n"
"| `+prod+`\n"
"| Produktions-Build: AOT, minimiert, Dateinamen mit Hash, ohne Source-Maps, mit Lizenzdatei\n"
"| `+openems-edge-prod+`\n"
"| Edge direkt über `+ws(s)://<Host>:8075+`. Standard-Port von `+Controller.Api.Websocket+` ist 8085, also dort umstellen.\n"
"| `+openems-edge-docker+`\n"
"| Edge über `+ws(s)://<Host>/openems-edge+`; braucht den nginx-Proxy des UI-Images\n"
"| `+openems-backend-prod+`\n"
"| Backend über `+ws(s)://<Host>:8082+`\n"
"| `+openems-backend-docker+`\n"
"| Backend über `+ws(s)://<Host>/openems-backend+`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid ""
"The addresses are in `+ui/src/themes/openems/environments/*.ts+`. A build "
"with `+-c \"openems,openems-edge-dev,prod\"+` is optimized and connects to "
"port 8085. New apps in the App Center do not require a UI build (see "
"xref:development/implementing/apps.adoc[Apps for the App Center])."
msgstr ""
"Die Adressen stehen in `+ui/src/themes/openems/environments/*.ts+`. Ein "
"Build mit `+-c \"openems,openems-edge-dev,prod\"+` ist optimiert und "
"verbindet sich mit Port 8085. Für neue Apps im App Center ist kein UI-Build "
"nötig (siehe xref:development/implementing/apps.adoc[Apps für das App "
"Center])."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid ""
"As a Docker image, from the root directory of the repository (default "
"configuration `+openems,openems-edge-docker,prod+`, see xref:ui/deploy/"
"docker.adoc[Deploy UI to Docker]):"
msgstr ""
"Als Docker-Image, aus dem Wurzelverzeichnis des Repositorys (Standard-"
"Konfiguration `+openems,openems-edge-docker,prod+`, siehe xref:latest@ui/"
"deploy/docker.adoc[Deploy UI to Docker]):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "docker build -f tools/docker/ui/Dockerfile.edge -t openems_ui_edge:custom .\n"
msgstr "docker build -f tools/docker/ui/Dockerfile.edge -t openems_ui_edge:custom .\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/data/export.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Hinweise"

#. type: #sec-notes
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid ""
"The Edge targets weak hardware (about 1 GB RAM, 2 cores). Computationally "
"intensive logic does not belong in every Cycle."
msgstr ""
"Die Edge zielt auf schwache Hardware (etwa 1 GB RAM, 2 Kerne). "
"Rechenintensive Logik gehört nicht in jeden Zyklus."

#. type: #sec-notes
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/build/commands.adoc
msgid ""
"The repository contains `+CLAUDE.md+` and `+AGENTS.md+` with short rules for "
"code style and tests."
msgstr ""
"Das Repository enthält `+CLAUDE.md+` und `+AGENTS.md+` mit Kurzregeln für "
"Code-Stil und Tests."
